    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golf of America</strong> is not just a golfing game\u2014<strong>you <i>are</i> the ball</strong>. Feel the wind rush past as you soar through the air, navigating challenging courses with precision and finesse. Master your shots, adapt to dynamic environments, and chase the perfect stroke across a variety of handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more? Unleash your creativity with the in-game level editor and build your own courses for endless replayability. Share them with others and push the limits of what a golf game can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the ball. Feel the breeze. Dominate the course.</strong><br>Welcome to <i>Golf of America</i>\u2014where every shot is personal.<br><br>Features:<br>1. Large single player levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Multiplayer leader-boards based on single-player experiences\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Wind affects your shots/swings.<br>4. Custom level editor to create infinite maps and infinite replayablity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Shop and in game currency (GP) to unlock balls and shot power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Steam items earned by scoring holes to unlock GP reward multipliers &amp; upgrades and ball unlocks. As well as trading &amp; quick paid access if you want to progress faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golf of America</strong> is not just a golfing game\u2014<strong>you <i>are</i> the ball</strong>. Feel the wind rush past as you soar through the air, navigating challenging courses with precision and finesse. Master your shots, adapt to dynamic environments, and chase the perfect stroke across a variety of handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more? Unleash your creativity with the in-game level editor and build your own courses for endless replayability. Share them with others and push the limits of what a golf game can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the ball. Feel the breeze. Dominate the course.</strong><br>Welcome to <i>Golf of America</i>\u2014where every shot is personal.<br><br>Features:<br>1. Large single player levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Multiplayer leader-boards based on single-player experiences\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Wind affects your shots/swings.<br>4. Custom level editor to create infinite maps and infinite replayablity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Shop and in game currency (GP) to unlock balls and shot power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Steam items earned by scoring holes to unlock GP reward multipliers &amp; upgrades and ball unlocks. As well as trading &amp; quick paid access if you want to progress faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
